#: synthDrivers/googleTtsForNvda/catalog.py:280
msgid ""
"Google TTS For NVDA could not be loaded because the WASM TTS Engine library "
"is incomplete.\n"
"\n"
"Reinstall Google TTS For NVDA with the complete WASM TTS Engine library."
msgstr ""
"无法加载 NVDA 谷歌TTS插件，因为 WASM TTS 引擎库不完整。\n"
"\n"
"请使用完整的 WASM TTS 引擎库重新安装 NVDA 谷歌TTS插件。"

#: synthDrivers/googleTtsForNvda/catalog.py:275
msgid ""
"Google TTS For NVDA could not be loaded because the WASM TTS Engine library "
"is missing.\n"
"\n"
"Reinstall Google TTS For NVDA with the included WASM TTS Engine library."
msgstr ""
"由于缺少 WASM TTS 引擎库，无法加载 NVDA 谷歌TTS插件。\n"
"\n"
"请使用随附的 WASM TTS 引擎库重新安装 NVDA 谷歌TTS插件。"

#: synthDrivers/googleTtsForNvda/catalog.py:269
msgid ""
"Google TTS For NVDA could not be loaded because the WASM TTS Engine version "
"is not supported.\n"
"\n"
"This add-on supports WASM TTS Engine version {supported}, but found: "
"{found}.\n"
"\n"
"Install a Google TTS For NVDA package that includes the supported WASM TTS "
"Engine."
msgstr ""
"无法加载 NVDA 谷歌TTS插件，因为 WASM TTS 引擎版本不受支持。\n"
"\n"
"此插件支持 WASM TTS 引擎 {supported} 版，但检测到的版本是：{found}。\n"
"\n"
"请安装包含受支持 WASM TTS 引擎的 NVDA 谷歌TTS插件安装包。"

#: synthDrivers/googleTtsForNvda/catalog.py:284
msgid ""
"Google TTS For NVDA could not be loaded because the WASM TTS Engine voice "
"catalog could not be read.\n"
"\n"
"Reinstall Google TTS For NVDA with a supported WASM TTS Engine library."
msgstr ""
"无法加载 NVDA 谷歌TTS插件，因为无法读取 WASM TTS 引擎的语音目录。\n"
"\n"
"请重新安装包含受支持 WASM TTS 引擎库的 NVDA 谷歌TTS插件。"

